text.autoconfig.simplevisuals.option.vis:
Lines around the screen when you move fast or
speed up suddenly (walking, riding or gliding);
first-person view only. Default: On.

simplevisuals.effect.water_droplets.tool:
Movement in water. Default: Global level. At
most 24 particles per tick, 4 per player;
Vanilla Minimal disables them.

simplevisuals.effect.beacon_aura.tooltip:
Adjacent beacon. Default: Global level. At
most 24 particles per tick, 4 per player;
Vanilla Minimal disables them.
